  m_text: "I found this Jade at the end of a corridor in the cave, next to the lake.
    It\u2019s shiny, and not quite see through, but it does look glassy. I\u2019m
    sure it costs a lot on the market, but the potions I\u2019ll be making with this
    will cost much more (I hope.)"
