  m_text: "In northern-east parts of the cave, you found the Common Bat, blood-sucking
    nightmares that seemingly hate everything that\u2019s not themselves. I could
    probably bring more than the wings back to the lab, but I\u2019m scared it would
    come back to life."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b022087a32b99574cbc1ebbf52924c94, type: 2}
