      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Bordering the river north-east in the forest grows the Luminescent Fruit.
    The body is squishy, it\u2019s funny but I\u2019m scared it could burst during
    transport. Now that I think about it, I could use those as a bottle to refresh
    myself."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b022087a32b99574cbc1ebbf52924c94, type: 2}
