  m_text: "This plant grows close to the shop, in the south-most part of the forest.
    I\u2019m not exactly sure if it\u2019s a flower or just weirdly shaped grass,
    because green flowers are usually rare, but they do look pretty. Unsurprisingly,
    they taste like grass."
