      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "It makes its home in the middle of the forest, where the sun shines the
    most at midday. It reminds me of a certain fire bird of legend, but it looks
    more akin to the sun, like it grew from lava. I\u2019d take a nap in a field
    of those for some warmth."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b022087a32b99574cbc1ebbf52924c94, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 4818060003521118993, guid: b022087a32b99574cbc1ebbf52924c94, type: 2}
